| | area 71 | unrestricted |
|---|---|---|
| species expanded | 2,469 | 5,150 |
| species with `a`/`b` | 764 | 1,283 |
| length-weight rows | 2,970 | 5,225 |
| taxon codes with length-length | 38 | 39 |

